      description: 'The one reusable multipart upload endpoint used across the API
        — vehicle-type icons, vehicle photos, document scans, KYC documents, damage-report/proof
        photos, and more, distinguished by the `purpose` field. Stores to Azure Blob
        if configured, otherwise local filesystem storage for dev. Returns `{"url":
        ...}`; the caller passes that URL into a separate, later request that creates/updates
        the actual record (e.g. registering a vehicle document).'
